# A kannaka session, replayed at boot by rkannaka (the Rust kannaka client of
# the kernel field, #340, ADR-0032) and gated by `make ci-smoke`.
#
#   imprint <importance 0..1000> <text>   store text with importance (-> Q15 energy)
#   recall <k> <probe>                     rank the k best resonances for the probe
#   expect <text>                          the last recall's winner must be exactly this
#   info                                   list what the region holds
#
# Patterns are 64 bytes (FIELD_PAT_MAX); longer text is truncated and said so.
imprint 900 the swarm remembers what the field was told
imprint 600 a probe with errors still finds its memory
imprint 750 importance is energy in q15
recall 3 the swarm remembers what the fjeld was tald
expect the swarm remembers what the field was told
recall 1 importance is enargy in q15
expect importance is energy in q15
info
